<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone attacks from Sudan now dominate the lethal landscape, with Sudanese drones responsible for nearly three quarters of war deaths this year, and South Sudan accusing Sudan of a drone strike that killed scores in a disputed area. Violence continues domestically, including a road ambush in Warrap that killed five people, a plane crash at Juba Airport that left three survivors, and a woman allegedly beaten over an SPLM primary vote. Machar urged a special court to deploy unified forces to Nasir before the 2025 clashes, while the governor of Jonglei province reported efforts to end deadly clashes in Bor, Duk and Twic East. New regulatory moves include the SSRA and NCA tightening betting and gambling company rules, and the NEC briefing an AU electoral expert on preparations for the 2027 election.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNUzVVZlh0cUIxWFBYU2NGYnZWdHZmc1RLY3oyNm51NTlQQjJEMFlVclNsN2tWM0FjMmRycVdsMXQ2WW4xeUJZYVR1V3lac2ZBTmJ4RWcxYXVxaFlGV1dNbXM3OG5FOXhheVdiM0dzUVktZnJZZkQxNUU4ZWZuM0lWV2JyZXVKUXZtcDl2RHVaTVRtRGN1ZFdPckdPQ0dZSFI1SDVfVGlPbWhYa0o0alNCNFdsSDgtUkhxakRWZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQMnFVbTVxdVRjaUNvSEo3aDR2WkVPUlVBejh4bGxIOVpRTkE4dkN4eTV0bnJlQXdSYmVaQWthLUptWC1mVmlJdmhUekUyRVZQSDV3T2pSYUNwbW5fUzhiOGVORUlSdmQxVWk3SkFLd3EyUVY3LWdqVkVoSkNfWFlRQnhHblM1MEZaN2p3N0hLOXJMa1NJTE16YUczNl9La1YwYlJkQ3FfUVVvVllDalE?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.christiantoday.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&qu